by smnandre at 2025-02-26T14:30:04Z

If i add a `stimulusFetch: lazy` to the Stimulus controller, the lazyness is respected, only the scripts required for the diagram type are loaded.

```js
import { Controller } from '@hotwired/stimulus';
import mermaid from 'mermaid';

/* stimulusFetch: 'lazy' */
export default class extends Controller {
    async connect() {
        mermaid.initialize({
            startOnLoad: false,
            securityLevel: 'loose',
            theme: 'forest',
            themeVariables: {
                primaryColor: '#ffc107',
            }
        });

        await mermaid.run({
            querySelector: '.mermaid',
        });
    }
}
```

(code taken from the original issue #53145 - added the lazy part )

